{'symbol': 'CAH', 'date': '2021-11-18 08:15:00', 'title': "CARDINAL HEALTH'S WAVEMARK™ LAUNCHES SUPPLY AUTOMATION SOLUTION FOR CLINICAL LABS", 'text': 'DUBLIN, OHIO, NOV. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CARDINAL HEALTH TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS BUSINESS, WAVEMARK™ SUPPLY MANAGEMENT AND WORKFLOW SOLUTIONS, WILL NOW BE AVAILABLE FOR IMPLEMENTATION IN CLINICAL LABS ACROSS THE U.S. "WAVEMARK IS AMONG THE FIRST\xa0IN THE INDUSTRY TO OPTIMIZE CLINICAL LAB PROCESSES THROUGH CUTTING-EDGE AUTOMATION," SAID SHAWN MCBRIDE, VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER, WAVEMARK. "TIMING MATTERS IN THE LAB: THE FASTER TEST RESULTS ARE DELIVERED FROM THE LAB, THE FASTER A DIAGNOSIS CAN BE MADE AND TREATMENT CAN BEGIN.'}